<TXT>Deem the material to conform with the requirements for weld shear strength if the average of the test results 
of the first four specimens or if the average of the test results for all welds tested comply with TABLE 2.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Panel to Panel Joint Strength</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Use the minimum strength of the joined panels, when tested as described in <RID>ASTM A974</RID> Section 13.5, as follows:</TXT><BRK/>
